KEYZ-F5-AMD experimental runtime

Based on F5-TTS by SWivid and the community F5-TTS-ONNX conversion by DakeQQ.
This is an independent runtime project, not an official AMD, Microsoft, SWivid
or DakeQQ release. No claim of employment or upstream co-authorship is made.

Algorithm reference: DakeQQ/F5-TTS-ONNX,
commit 47173d5fe22eefd1adc4dab3b8829d227f307e29 (Apache-2.0).
https://github.com/DakeQQ/F5-TTS-ONNX
https://github.com/SWivid/F5-TTS

Local adaptations include persistent sessions, separate DirectML input/output
buffers, request validation, exact asset checks and a 13-step full-trajectory
coarsened schedule. This schedule is experimental, not an official native
EPSS export and not a model retraining or distillation claim.

The Apache-2.0 code license does NOT relicense pretrained weights. Upstream
F5-TTS describes pretrained weights as CC-BY-NC due to their training data.
Respect the applicable model terms and obtain permission to use voice samples.
No weights, voice samples, private transcripts or generated speech are shipped.
